[02:35] [scene:talk]
VISUAL: 
AUDIO: 'truck that will have a lift gate. So, they\'ll be able to set the pallet on the ground for you. It actually comes in two separate pallets. one with the actual air conditioner unit and the other with the solar panels on it. Now, I was able to just cut off the plastic, lift each'

[02:47] [scene:talk]
VISUAL: 
AUDIO: 'panel one by one off that and put them in place. So, you don\'t need a forklift for this thing. I didn\'t have one. I was able to unload all of it all by myself. Now, let\'s go check out what comes in the box and then I will show you this'

